       "elements": []
      },
      {
       "id": "17df8a36",
       "elType": "widget",
       "widgetType": "text-editor",
       "settings": {
        "editor": "<p style=\"max-width:624px;\">Most production gets booked one person at a time — a shooter here, an\n      editor somewhere else, and a client left holding it together.</p>",
        "text_color": "#E4E5E1",
        "typography_typography": "custom",
        "typography_font_family": "Montserrat",
        "typography_font_size": {
         "unit": "px",
         "size": 21
        },
        "typography_line_height": {
         "unit": "px",
         "size": 31.68
        },
        "typography_font_weight": "600"
       },
       "elements": []
      },
      {
       "id": "181d6838",
       "elType": "widget",
       "widgetType": "spacer",
       "settings": {
        "space": {
         "unit": "px",
         "size": 18
        }
       },
       "elements": []
      },
      {
       "id": "185b463a",
       "elType": "widget",
       "widgetType": "text-editor",
       "settings": {
        "editor": "<p style=\"max-width:615px;\">We run the whole thing in-house, from the first planning conversation to the final\n      delivered file. There is no handover between a freelancer and a stranger, because there\n      is no handover — the people who plan your shoot are the people who turn up to it and the\n      people who cut it.</p><p style=\"max-width:615px;\">Behind that crew is Chilli, the Sunshine Coast marketing agency that has been growing\n      local businesses since 1993. It changes the first question we ask: not what you want the\n      work to look like, but what it has to achieve.</p><p style=\"max-width:615px;\">And the vans are the part you can actually see. A factory floor, a plantation access\n      track or a construction site works as easily as a boardroom — no scrambling for power, no\n      half-day lost to logistics.</p>",
        "text_color": "#A9ABAE",
        "typography_typography": "custom",
        "typography_font_family": "Montserrat",
        "typography_font_size": {
         "unit": "px",
         "size": 16
        },
        "typography_line_height": {
         "unit": "px",
         "size": 26.88
        }
       },
       "elements": []
      }
     ]
